---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="reveal" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <SectionHeading id="about-h" index="02" title="About" />
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      I'm a Computer Science student and full-stack developer based in Olongapo City, focused on building
      complete products — from the interfaces people use to the systems running behind them. I've delivered an
      AI-driven health application, a rental-management platform for a real client, and an award-winning
      heritage kiosk, and I care about the details that make software feel considered and finished.
    </p>
    <p>
      I treat every project as a chance to sharpen my craft and raise my own standard. Right now I'm deepening
      my work with React, and I'm always looking for opportunities to build software that's genuinely useful
      to the people who use it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-body {
    max-width: 58ch;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .about-body p + p {
    margin-top: 1.2em;
  }
</style>
